          }
        ],
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "details"
        }
      },
      "description": "One marker per tracked species: its most recent observation. Coordinates are split out of iNaturalist's \"lat,lon\" string with label_replace() in a recording rule — PromQL can carry geography too.",
